  "description": "Sampati, a Jaunpuri speaker from Dewalsari in the Garhwal region of Uttarakhand, India, talks about Aadhaar and access to public information. Jaunpuri is a dialect of Garhwali. Subhashish Panigrahi interviewed Sampati on 8 November 2019 for his 2021 documentary MarginalizedAadhaar. Panigrahi edited unused or trimmed footage from the film and published it under the OpenSpeaks Archives project in 2026. Hindi subtitles are by Arun Gour and Manoj Bilwal, edited by Panigrahi.",
